    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">For the item obtained at <a href=\"/w/Slimeball#VII\" title=\"Slimeball\">Slimeball&#160;<code>VII</code> (7)</a>, see <a href=\"/w/Launch_Pad\" title=\"Launch Pad\">Launch Pad</a>.</div>\n<div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Launch Pad (Structure)</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Launch_Pad_(Hub_Island_to_The_Park).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Launch Pad (Hub Island to The Park).png\"><img alt=\"Launch Pad (Hub Island to The Park).png\" src=\"/images/Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_The_Park%29.png?51711\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"788\" height=\"1000\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"788\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Launch Pads</b> are structures found at the edges of public <a href=\"/w/Islands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Islands\">Islands</a>, launching the player between areas.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Game_Messages\">Game Messages</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Launch_Pad_(Structure)?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Game Messages\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Launch_Pad_(Structure)?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Game Messages\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Condition\n</th>\n<th>Message\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Using a Launch Pad\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-7\">Sending to server &lt;server&gt;...</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Failing to use a Launch Pad\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">Unable to use this launch pad at the moment, please try again later. </span><span class=\"format-7\">(PLAYER_TRANSFER_COOLDOWN)</span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Launch_Pad_(Structure)?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Launch_Pad_(Structure)?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Gallery\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Launch_Pad_(Hub_Island_to_The_Park).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Launch Pad from Hub Island to  The Park\"><img alt=\"Launch Pad from Hub Island to  The Park\" src=\"/images/thumb/Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_The_Park%29.png/94px-Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_The_Park%29.png?51711\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"94\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_The_Park%29.png/189px-Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_The_Park%29.png?51711 2x\" data-file-width=\"788\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Launch Pad from <a href=\"/w/Hub_Island\" title=\"Hub Island\">Hub Island</a> to <a href=\"/w/The_Park\" title=\"The Park\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">The Park</span></a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Launch_Pad_(Hub_Island_to_Spider%27s_Den).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Launch Pad from Hub Island to  Spider&#39;s Den\"><img alt=\"Launch Pad from Hub Island to  Spider&#39;s Den\" src=\"/images/thumb/Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_Spider%27s_Den%29.png/108px-Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_Spider%27s_Den%29.png?f52f4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"108\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_Spider%27s_Den%29.png/217px-Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_Spider%27s_Den%29.png?f52f4 2x\" data-file-width=\"903\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Launch Pad from <a href=\"/w/Hub_Island\" title=\"Hub Island\">Hub Island</a> to <a href=\"/w/Spider%27s_Den\" title=\"Spider&#39;s Den\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\">Spider's Den</span></a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Launch_Pad_(Hub_Island_to_Gold_Mine).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Launch Pad from Hub Island to  Gold Mine\"><img alt=\"Launch Pad from Hub Island to  Gold Mine\" src=\"/images/thumb/Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_Gold_Mine%29.png/68px-Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_Gold_Mine%29.png?eb412\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"68\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_Gold_Mine%29.png/135px-Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_Gold_Mine%29.png?eb412 2x\" data-file-width=\"565\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Launch Pad from <a href=\"/w/Hub_Island\" title=\"Hub Island\">Hub Island</a> to <a href=\"/w/Gold_Mine\" title=\"Gold Mine\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Gold Mine</span></a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Launch_Pad_(Hub_Island_to_The_Farming_Islands).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Launch Pad from Hub Island to The Farming Islands\"><img alt=\"Launch Pad from Hub Island to The Farming Islands\" src=\"/images/thumb/Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_The_Farming_Islands%29.png/96px-Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_The_Farming_Islands%29.png?991dd\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"96\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_The_Farming_Islands%29.png/192px-Launch_Pad_%28Hub_Island_to_The_Farming_Islands%29.png?991dd 2x\" data-file-width=\"799\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Launch Pad from <a href=\"/w/Hub_Island\" title=\"Hub Island\">Hub Island</a> to <a href=\"/w/The_Farming_Islands\" class=\"mw-redirect mw-disambig\" title=\"The Farming Islands\">The Farming Islands</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Launch_Pad_(Structure)?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Launch_Pad_(Structure)?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2019/June_11\" title=\"Changelog/2019/June 11\">Jun&#160;11,&#160;2019</a></th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.1</th><td>Added <b>Launch Pad</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2019/August_2\" title=\"Changelog/2019/August 2\">Aug&#160;2,&#160;2019</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\">0.7</th><td>Now say \"Travel to\" instead of \"Warp to\".</td></tr><tr><td>The spawn of most <b>Launch Pads</b> are now a couple of blocks further away from them to prevent players from accidentally using them.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐jobrunner‐847db4cdb‐hq4kj\nCached time: 20261023050346\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.118 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.232 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 147/1000000\nRevision size: 1321/8388608 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 4821/8388608 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 913/8388608 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3527/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/50\nBucket time usage: 0.000/10 seconds\nLua time usage: 0.067/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 3376515/367001600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  203.085      1 -total\n 44.86%   91.109      1 Template:For\n 36.19%   73.494      1 Template:Coll\n 20.54%   41.708      1 Template:History_table\n 15.14%   30.750      2 Template:History\n 14.18%   28.804      3 Template:Zone\n  7.12%   14.457      1 Template:Infobox/Generic\n  3.93%    7.976      2 Template:Dialogue\n  2.34%    4.752      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_hypixelskyblockwiki:pcache:16194:|#|:idhash:canonical and